        question: 'If the rear reaches the final array cell, can the queue still use a free cell at index 0?',
        observe: 'Use a five-cell array indexed 0:4. Front points to the next item for removal; Rear points to the last inserted item; Count records how many items are active. The next position after 4 wraps to 0.',
